<div class="page-header">
    <h1>🎯 Dashboard</h1>
    <p>Telnyx Media Streaming Application</p>
</div>

<div class="dashboard-grid">
    <div class="card">
        <h2>📱 Make a Call</h2>
        <p>Initiate a new outbound call with media streaming enabled</p>
        <a href="/calls/new" class="btn btn-primary">Start New Call</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>📞 Active Calls</h2>
        <p>View and manage your active calls in real-time</p>
        <a href="/calls" class="btn btn-primary">View Calls</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>🎧 Your Number</h2>
        <p><strong><%= telnyxPhoneNumber %></strong></p>
        <p>This is your Telnyx phone number configured for receiving calls</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>📊 Features</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>✅ Real-time Media Streaming</li>
            <li>✅ DTMF Digit Detection</li>
            <li>✅ Call Recordings</li>
            <li>✅ WebSocket Integration</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="info-section">
    <h2>Getting Started</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Configure your Telnyx API key in the .env file</li>
        <li>Set up your connection ID and phone number</li>
        <li>Click "Start New Call" to make your first call</li>
        <li>Monitor media streaming in real-time</li>
        <li>Receive DTMF and other call events via webhooks</li>
    </ol>
</div>
